meta {
  name: saveProductSeo
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveProductSeo",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "language": "nl",
      "seo_slug": "mijn-product",
      "seo_title": "Mijn product"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Set SEO metadata for a product in a specific language

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `product_id` | integer | yes | Internal ID of the product |
  | `language` | string | yes | BCP 47 language code (e.g. nl, nl-BE) |
  | `context_id` | integer | no | Channel context ID; defaults to 1 |
  | `seo_slug` | string (nullable) | no | URL-friendly slug for the product page |
  | `seo_title` | string (nullable) | no | HTML title tag content for the product page |
  | `seo_description` | string (nullable) | no | HTML meta description for the product page |
  | `seo_keywords` | string (nullable) | no | HTML meta keywords for the product page |

  **Example: Set Dutch SEO data**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveProductSeo",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "language": "nl",
      "seo_slug": "mijn-product",
      "seo_title": "Mijn product"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_id": 123,
    "language": "nl",
    "context_id": 1
  }
  ```
}
